cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pkinative-cli in academic work or cite it in publications,
  please cite it using the metadata below.
title: "pkinative-cli — the command line for the pkinative PKI toolkit"
abstract: >-
  The official command-line interface of pkinative: inspect and verify X.509
  certificates, certification requests, CRLs, OCSP responses, CMS SignedData
  and RFC 3161 time-stamps; build and validate certification paths; create
  certificates, requests and CMS signatures; open PKCS#8 and PKCS#12 — offline,
  with pkinative as its only runtime dependency, every export of the engine
  reached by a command, and a stable JSON contract for scripts and AI agents.
type: software
